        "content": "## ⚡ LinkedIn Viral Post Search & Thought-Leader Content Miner (No Cookies)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nFind high-intent LinkedIn posts by keyword without session cookies to trigger warm social selling outreach and AI comment generation.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-post-search-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-post-search-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Post Search Scraper (No Cookies)** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
